# Anchored to the repository root. The runtime frame cache lives at
# ./data/projects/<project-id>/; an unanchored `data/` also swallows
# visoswap/settings/data/presets_seed.json, which is generated offline and
# committed on purpose -- and `git add` of an ignored path fails loudly only
# if somebody is watching.
